{"discussions":[{"id":"c08b9ef0-b684-11f1-8080-80011d4a6923","post":{"id":"c08b9ef0-b684-11f1-8080-80011d4a6923","owner":{"id":"6707379","username":"CryptoPortfolio","firstName":"Cryptos by","lastName":"Market Cap","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/6421394/9.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/6421394/9.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/6421394/9.jpg"},"roles":["eTorian","CopyPortfolio","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":218,"piLevel":0,"isProInvestor":false,"badgeType":"None"},"obsoleteId":"d1f7675c-0749-4548-850a-f65afe13d168","created":"2026-09-22T12:54:30.751Z","message":{"text":"₿ Bitcoin Climbs Above $86,000 as Crypto Rally Extends\n\n👉 $BTC rose above $86,000 as its recent rally continued, trading around $85,863 — up about 5.8% on the day.\n\n👉 The cryptocurrency reached an intraday high of $86,349.90, its strongest level since late January.\n\n👉 Bitcoin has gained more than 8% over the past week and 34% over the past three months, although it remains down for the year.\n\n👉 Investors are assessing whether the crypto market’s prolonged downturn following Bitcoin’s October 2025 record high has ended.\n\n👉 The rally came despite the US Senate blocking the Clarity Act, which would have established a broader regulatory framework for crypto assets.\n\n💡 One interesting takeaway:\n\nThe move suggests that improving activity across blockchain networks and renewed investor appetite may be outweighing near-term uncertainty around US crypto legislation.\n\n\n🔎 Read more: https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/21/bitcoin-price-crypto-rally.html\n\n\n✨ $BTC is part of eToro’s @CryptoPortfolio Smart Portfolio, which provides exposure to cryptoassets selected by market capitalisation.\n\nThe portfolio is available with a minimum investment of $500 and includes holdings such as $ETH, $BNB, $XRP, $SOL, $TRX, $UNI and $XLM .\n\nYour capital is at risk. Past performance is not an indication of future results.","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-09-22T12:54:30.751Z","isDeleted":false,"type":"Default","metadata":{},"attachments":[{"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/cryptoportfolio/6a56d051-b411-484a-bd50-1ecce0ac8a86-2026-09-22.png","host":"openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com","mediaType":"Image","media":{"image":{"width":1200,"height":628,"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/cryptoportfolio/6a56d051-b411-484a-bd50-1ecce0ac8a86-2026-09-22.png"},"video":{"videoSource":"None","image":{"width":0,"height":0}}}}],"tags":[{"market":{"id":"100000","symbolName":"BTC","displayName":"Bitcoin","updated":"2026-09-26T02:54:58.071Z","assetType":"CryptoCoin","internalId":100000,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/btc/80x80.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/btc/90x90.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/btc/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/100000/100000_F0AF32_F7F7F7.svg","backgroundColor":"#F0AF32","textColor":"#F7F7F7"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":10,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":1001}},{"market":{"id":"100001","symbolName":"ETH","displayName":"Ethereum","updated":"2026-09-26T02:54:58.071Z","assetType":"CryptoCoin","internalId":100001,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/eth-usd/80x80.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/eth-usd/90x90.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/eth-usd/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/100001/100001_2C2C2C_F7F7F7.svg","backgroundColor":"#2C2C2C","textColor":"#F7F7F7"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":10,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":1001}},{"market":{"id":"100030","symbolName":"BNB","displayName":"Build and Build","updated":